OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee footballer who couldn't   
OL,4,Afind a team earns England call-up      
OL,6,FA footballer who was told as a young   
OL,7,Fchild that he could not play in matches
OL,8,Fwith other boys has just returned home 
OL,9,Fafter representing his country at the  
OL,10,FWorld Amputee Football Federation's    
OL,11,FWorld Cup in Mexico.                   
OL,13,FJamie Oakey, 23, from Blackpool, fell  
OL,14,Fin love with the beautiful game when he
OL,15,Fwas five. But it proved nigh-on        
OL,16,Fimpossible for his mum, Elaine, to find
OL,17,Fa team for him.                        
OL,19,FElaine said: "We couldn't find a team  
OL,20,For we found a team but were told 'he   
OL,21,Fcan train, but he'll never play in a   
OL,22,Fmatch'."                               
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
