OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee footballer who couldn't   
OL,4,Afind a team earns England call-up      
OL,6,FWhen she asked why this was the case,  
OL,7,FElaine said she was told: "Because he's
OL,8,Fgot one leg... he can't kick another   
OL,9,Fchild with a prosthetic."              
